cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use g2t, please cite the software and the version you used, together with the original publications of the GenBank records you analysed."
title: "g2t: GenBank to Taxonomy"
abstract: "Downloads the GenBank records of a taxon from NCBI and turns them into a specimen × gene matrix: metadata extraction, gene-type classification, voucher linking with evidence-based reconciliation of voucher variants."
type: software
authors:
